  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform rod of mass <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is hinged at its upper end. A particle of mass <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> moving horizontally strikes the rod at its midpoint elastically. If the particle comes to rest after collision, then, Find the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image24-2b929b41-1e15-4d77-ab62-31c1194635a5.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 109px; width: 80px;\" />",
